-- `link "x.so" as x` loads a native module (dlopen, both output modes —
-- never `cc`-time static linking, see runtime.c's `code_native_open`).
-- `emit ... to x [get name]` dispatches into it exactly like `to core`,
-- just at a module the program named itself instead of the built-in set.
link "native_modules/test_math.so" as m
emit Double { "value": 21 } to m get n
assert n = { "_class": "DoubleResult", "value": 42 }
